  This command is case-sensitive.

   Command      Description
 -------------  -------------------------------------------------------------
  <digit key>   select a basenote
   ^R           toggle "add response title"
   [?]          show this file
   [%]          close the note
   [a]          mark all messages unread
   [d]          delete your own basenote (asks for number)
   [g]          write an Author Write Only note
   [l],TAB      show basenotes that have unread responses
   [q],ESC      quit the index screen
   [i]          redraw the list (INDEX)  * i = list across all screens
   [v],^L       redraw the index screen
   [w]          write a basenote
   <Space>      to the older 20
   <BS>         to the newer 20
   [=]          to the latest page
   [*]          to the oldest page
   [f]          search title/body, then open by number
   [A]          ask a time, mark everything after it unread
   [k]          show this board's sign
 -------------  -------------------------------------------------------------
             INDEX shows 20 at a time. Page with Space / BS / = / *.
             Unread scan is new / open -s, or [l].
             Edit the sign via board (sys/cos) [7] sign.
             For external files, put a URL in the body (a note is shown).
